   11:  * PASS WITH REQUIRED CHANGES, changes applied).
   12:  *
   13:  * A contributor who just created submission S gets a random 256-bit token in an httpOnly cookie. The server stores
   14:  * only SHA-256(token) with an expiry. Saving the four contributor-owned fields consumes the token atomically, then
   15:  * saves guarded by status = UNREVIEWED. Nothing here grants general UPDATE access.
